OL,3,GNEWSAThe town that rioted against
OL,4,Asobriety
OL,5,
OL,6,FYou may not expect it, but Worthing was
OL,7,Fonce the scene of violent protests that
OL,8,Fgripped the whole of Southern England.
OL,10,FOn his guided tours of the West Sussex
OL,11,Ftown, local historian Chris Hare stops
OL,12,Fin the tucked-away Anne Street, just
OL,13,Foff the main thoroughfare.
OL,15,FHe tells his groups there was a riot
OL,16,Fhere on 17 August 1884 against the
OL,17,FSalvation Army involving thousands.
OL,19,F"People are like - what - that's like
OL,20,Frioting against the Easter Bunny - why
OL,21,Fwould anyone do that?" he says.
